{"id":"255774e81caebda9","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Scale","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-scale — ZFC Pcf2 Scale","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-scale — ZFC Pcf2 Scale","depends_on":["[[58-df-regular]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set]]","[[58-df-ideal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-scale — ZFC Pcf2 Scale"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"58-df-regular\">58-df-regular</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"434af3b8c053a816\" href=\"?note=434af3b8c053a816\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"390d99173de7c15c\" href=\"?note=390d99173de7c15c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,f,g\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,f,g\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(f,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S(A)\n\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)\\in a)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(f,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S(A)\n\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)\\in a)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}strict\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S(A,J,f,g)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\n\\land\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(f,A)\\land\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(g,A)\n\\land\\{a\\in A:g(a)\\in f(a)\\lor g(a)=f(a)\\}\\in J.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}strict\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S(A,J,f,g)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\n\\land\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(f,A)\\land\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(g,A)\n\\land\\{a\\in A:g(a)\\in f(a)\\lor g(a)=f(a)\\}\\in J.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}scale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\n\\land\\operatorname{Reg}(\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists B_f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,\\lambda,B_f)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(\\vec f(\\alpha),A)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S(A,J,\\vec f(\\alpha),\\vec f(\\beta)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(g,A)\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S(A,J,g,\\vec f(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}scale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\n\\land\\operatorname{Reg}(\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists B_f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,\\lambda,B_f)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(\\vec f(\\alpha),A)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S(A,J,\\vec f(\\alpha),\\vec f(\\beta)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(g,A)\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S(A,J,g,\\vec f(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The product predicate itself now records that its factors are regular cardinals, so the ordinal comparisons in the eventual order remain meaningful even when the helper is reused outside the final scale clause.</li>\n<li>Strict eventual domination is expanded with the bad set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{a:g(a)\\in f(a)\\lor g(a)=f(a)\\}\\in J\">\\(\\{a:g(a)\\in f(a)\\lor g(a)=f(a)\\}\\in J\\)</span>; ordinal membership replaces an unregistered generic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set","status":"resolved","id":"434af3b8c053a816","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set","status":"resolved","id":"390d99173de7c15c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,f,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(f,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S(A)\n\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)\\in a)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}strict\\text{-}eventual\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S(A,J,f,g)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\n\\land\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(f,A)\\land\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(g,A)\n\\land\\{a\\in A:g(a)\\in f(a)\\lor g(a)=f(a)\\}\\in J.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}scale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\n\\land\\operatorname{Reg}(\\lambda)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists B_f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,\\lambda,B_f)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\mathrm{PcfProduct}_S(\\vec f(\\alpha),A)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\mathrm{PcfStrictEventualOrder}_S(A,J,\\vec f(\\a